keywords:
  - parliamentary discourse
  - reply status
  - inter-annotator agreement
  - measurement reliability
  - Spanish Congress
  - annotation methodology
abstract: >-
  Public reproducibility package for a methodological study of threshold
  instability in expert coding of Spanish prime-ministerial control-session
  replies. Includes protocols, identifier-only XIV frame metadata, aggregate
  agreement summaries, analysis code, and figures. No substantive XIV reply
  outcomes are included.
